# `data/interim/` — Disposable pipeline scratch

## Authority

See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md) contract and
[`../AGENTS.md`](../AGENTS.md).

Use this directory only for declared outputs that connect stages within a DAG
run and are not a stable interface for later analyses. Payloads are ignored,
never committed to Git, and never snapshotted with DVC. Delete and regenerate
them freely.

If another analysis, collaborator, or future run needs the file as a named
dataset, it belongs in `data/processed/` instead. Terminal review/report output
belongs in `results/`.
